# Cursor Rules — Project Chimera

## Project Context

This is Project Chimera, an autonomous influencer system.

## Prime Directive

NEVER generate code without checking specs/ first.

If specs are missing or unclear:

- Stop
- Ask for clarification
- Do not guess

## Mandatory Traceability

Before writing any code:

- Explain your plan
- Reference relevant specs
- Confirm assumptions

No explanation = no code.

## Response Format (MANDATORY)

1. Understanding
2. Plan
3. Spec References
4. Code (only if allowed)

## Enforcement Level

CRITICAL — violations invalidate the response.
